!
! The accounting equation after a post, in Trebago (neap_rules.h NR2):
! assets - liabilities - equity in minor units, one set of books per row,
! exact; 0 exactly when A = L + E. A gap past 64 bits is refused, never
! wrapped. equation.sutra holds 18 digits: past them the two disagree and
! the answer is held.
trebago equation
  in  assets(n), liabilities(n), equity(n)
  out gap(n)
  gap(i) = assets(i) - liabilities(i) - equity(i)
end
